//- The design tokens of config/theme.yaml as --theme-* custom properties
//- (§S2.5), in one inline <style>. The rule is built by
//- themeBusiness.tokenRule() (helpers.pug), which drops every value with `<`,
//- `>`, `{`, `}` or `;` and every name not made of letters, digits, `-` and
//- `_`, so nothing in the YAML can break out of the rule.
if themeBusiness.tokenRule()
    style!= themeBusiness.tokenRule()
